ios.desc:
Are you ready for CAR HUNT? 
Every day you are going to be tasked to look for cars in the real world. Find the right car, get points and be ranked top of the leader board!
We have created artificial intelligence which uses your smartphone to identify the make and model of the car you have captured. As a bonus we will show how much that car costs.

Download CAR HUNTERS to:
- Perform various tasks and compete with your friends;
- Explore more than 3100 car makes and models;
- Build your unique collection of cars from different countries;
- Share your findings with your friends;
- Find the price of the cars you like.

Start your hunt NOW!
